    "Try Match and Listen.": "嘗試匹配並聆聽。",
    "Practice the same words in a different way, then return to the ones you want to review.": "以不同的方式練習相同的單字，然後回到您想要複習的單字。",
    "Take the first step": "踏出第一步",
    "Before you start": "開始之前",
    "Is FlashFluent free?": "FlashFluent 是免費的嗎？",
