    "Our next product goal is ten available language courses, giving more people access to practical language support for school, work, and daily life.": "我們的下一個產品目標是十個可用的語言課程，讓更多的人獲得學校、工作和日常生活的實用語言支援。",
    "More classrooms": "更多教室",
    "We are seeking volunteers to help onboard teachers and schools to FlashFluent and bring free language practice to more learners.": "我們正在尋找志工來幫助教師和學校使用 FlashFluent，並為更多學習者帶來免費的語言練習。",
