    "Discover animals, landscapes, and the natural world through illustrated vocabulary.": "Temukan hewan, lanskap, dan alam melalui kosakata bergambar.",
    "People & family": "Orang & keluarga",
    "Learn words for family members, people, feelings, and the relationships around you.": "Pelajari kata-kata untuk anggota keluarga, orang, perasaan, dan hubungan di sekitar Anda.",
    "Travel & places": "Perjalanan & tempat",
    "Practice transport and places around town, from bicycles and buses to your next destination.": "Latih transportasi dan tempat-tempat di sekitar kota, mulai dari sepeda dan bus hingga tujuan Anda berikutnya.",
    "Home & daily life": "Rumah & kehidupan sehari-hari",
    "Build vocabulary for daily actions, household spaces, clothing, and familiar routines.": "Bangun kosakata untuk tindakan sehari-hari, ruang rumah tangga, pakaian, dan rutinitas yang akrab.",
    "School & work": "Sekolah & bekerja",
    "Explore collections about school, professions, technology, and the working world.": "Jelajahi koleksi tentang sekolah, profesi, teknologi, dan dunia kerja.",
